blocks.en:
Table 8 : Conditioning and embedding details . Canonical align.: ✓ = canonical axis transformation applied; ✗ = no canonical transformation. Shape param.: ✓ = shape parameters included in the conditioning; ✗ = shape parameters excluded from the conditioning. Cartesian joints: ✓ = Cartesian joint coordinates with PointNet embeddings; ✗ = 6D rotation coordinates with cyclic embeddings. abs. cyl. denotes absolute cylindrical coordinates and canon. denotes canonicalized coordinates.
The third column group reports the dimensionality of each conditioning representation before embedding;
while the final column gives the total conditioning-token count used by each variant.

blocks.zh:
表8:条件和嵌入细节 canonical conference.: ✓ = 适用克能轴转换; ✗ = 无克能克转换. 形状参数: * = 形状参数包含在条件中; * = 形状参数不包括在条件中. 笛卡尔关节: ✓ = 笛卡尔联合坐标与PointNet嵌入; ✗ = 6D旋转坐标与循环嵌入. abs. cyl.表示绝对圆柱形坐标和横琴.
第三栏小组在嵌入前报告每个条件表示的维度;
而最后一栏给出了每个变体所使用的总的调值。
